  "measured_conclusion": "The warm auxiliary image accumulates secular coefficient strength, predominantly outside the production support, and corrupts its full-support boundary forcing. Falling representation residual and relative native amplification are insufficient to admit this nonphysical time sequence. The full-support force drift is not evidence that native production wake truncation causes the force deficit.",
